# 301s for the English pages, which moved under /en/ when German became the
# default, unprefixed locale.
#
# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets parses this file from the assets directory
# and applies it before serving any asset. It is not served as an asset itself.
# Limits: 2000 static and 100 dynamic rules.
#
# Comments must stay at column 0, same parser rule as public/_headers.
# A syntax error is dropped silently at upload, so verify with `npx wrangler dev`
# before deploying rather than after.

/services                          /en/services                        301
/hire                              /en/hire                            301
/projects/ar-data-visualization    /en/projects/ar-data-visualization  301
/projects/llm-maven-plugin         /en/projects/llm-maven-plugin       301

# Deliberately four explicit rules rather than /projects/* -> /en/projects/:splat.
# A splat would also swallow any future /projects/... path that is meant to be
# served directly.
#
# "/" is never redirected: it is the German homepage.
# /leistungen/*, /projekte/*, /impressum and /datenschutz are already indexed at
# these exact URLs and must not move.
